WEBVTT

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:06.470
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:12.740
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.540
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:22.020
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:25.760
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.430
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:36.410
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:45.280
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:56.430
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:00.630
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:04.290
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:11.440
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:20.350
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:59.090
Kenetos, come out!

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:07.020
You summoned me,
Grand Demon Marshal?

00:02:07.020 --> 00:02:12.020
Go forth Kenetos, and claim all
that you desire!

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:15.300
As you wish, Grand Demon Marshal.

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:17.540
Well then, I shall go.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:35.460
DEMON KENETOS
THE MYSTERIOUS NECKLACE

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:11.730
COMIC
"DEVILMAN"

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:32.710
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!
That hurts! I was sleeping!

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.060
Akira, good morning!

00:03:44.150 --> 00:03:45.190
Akira!

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:47.390
- Shut up...
- Akira!

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:49.820
Fine, I'm awake.

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.810
All right, don't be late today!

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:56.140
I might be awake, but
I'm not getting out of bed.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.060
Demon Marshal Lacock!

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:12.510
Devilman, it has been far too long.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:14.050
Don't act friendly with me!

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:17.620
Lively as ever, I see!

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:22.630
But you cannot possibly defeat the
demon I just sent to the human world.

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:25.260
- What?
- Just look on hopelessly!

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:27.240
That will be all you can do.

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:31.480
Since I am kind, I have taken
time to come and warn you.

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:33.010
Shut the hell up!

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.120
Damn!

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:47.990
Damn you, Lacock...

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:04.140
What's this for? It's too
early for Christmas presents.

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:08.210
How pretty!

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:16.480
— Papa! Mama!

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:18.920
- What's wrong? What is it?!
- Papa! Mama!

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:26.090
Yoshiko!

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:30.900
What happened?!
Yoshiko!

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:40.230
It's cold!
I really do hate winter.

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:43.650
I don't care if I'm late.
I'll face the consequences!

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:45.550
Huh?

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:52.810
What's this doing here?

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:54.890
What an unexpected gift!

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:57.790
I'll give it to Miki
when I get to school.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:01.630
Maybe she'll give me a kiss in return!

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:07.070
Miki wearing a necklace,
how lovely!

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:10.840
I'm sure she'll look as
beautiful as an angel!

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:17.350
What? I must have fallen asleep
again, though my eyes are open!

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:21.020
Hey there, Alphonne!

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:25.190
Alphonne, you clever
boy, wake up!

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:28.260
Huh? What?!
MY head's gone!

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:30.450
I've literally lost my head!

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:35.700
How strange. If my mouth's in
my head, then how am I talking?

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:41.840
A head! A disembodied head!
A crying disembodied head!

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:46.970
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!
That hurts!

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:48.540
I hurt myself
but I've gotta run!

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:57.080
Calm down.
You don't have a body, either.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:58.320
What?

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:00.930
I don't know what's going on!

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:06.290
When I put on that necklace...
My head glowed like it was on fire!

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:10.290
And when I turned my head,
I found myself here.

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:13.770
So then, where are our bodies?

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:33.880
A headless man!

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:36.090
Mommy, help me!

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:41.120
Akira, are you feeling all right?

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:43.290
Yeah. I've just got
a lot on my mind.

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:46.230
I can't imagine Akira having
anything on his mind!

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.130
Moron!

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:48.800
Do you have a cold?
Maybe a fever?

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:51.000
Don't touch him!

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:54.040
Don't go near him!

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.140
Lala!

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:00.310
Hi!

00:08:02.310 --> 00:08:03.650
It's you again!

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:06.650
Akira, good morning!
Tare, what's up?

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:07.990
Yo!

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:13.190
You're going to school, right?
I'll come with.

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:16.990
Lala. Your name's Lala, right?

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:20.590
I'm so happy! You
remembered my name!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.170
But, I'm afraid I have
no interest in girls!

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:27.010
Knock it off!
What makes you think...

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.610
- Wh-What's that?
- It's a ghost!

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:37.680
Wait, Miki. Haven't we seen
that awful posture before?

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:39.850
I think I'd remember if
I had a ghost friend!

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.120
I-It's the teacher!

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:45.790
It's Mr. Alphonne!

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:48.960
See? He's scratching
his athlete's foot as usual!

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:58.580
I lost my body, but it's weird!
My legs ache! My hands and feet ache!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.340
What is it?
I don't see anything!

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:03.780
Right above you!

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:07.540
Yikes!

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:18.190
Where's he going?

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:23.290
I wonder what's going on?

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:40.180
Help me! It's a headless monster!

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:45.060
It's still after me!

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:48.590
Someone help me!
It's a monster!

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.290
Help me!

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:03.600
Wait!

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:10.240
NAKADO ACADEMY

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:17.140
D-Don't come near!

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:20.890
I'll give you a hundred
yen if you leave me alone!

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:30.130
I can't breathe! Let me go!
Please let me go!

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:34.360
Live in the darkness
of Kenetos for all eternity!

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:38.710
Without your head, you can see nothing.
You can live in a peaceful world.

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:43.300
Soon you will have
more and more friends.

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:45.780
You will not be lonely.

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:53.280
Demon Kenetos catches humans
without ever leaving his realm!

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:55.990
How do you expect
to battle him, Devilman?

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:09.030
He's headed for the school.
It really is Alphonne.

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:10.670
You wait here!

00:11:13.470 --> 00:11:14.940
I have no idea what's going on.

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:18.440
This must be the work of a demon,
just as Lacock said!

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:34.130
- Achoo!
- Forgive me!

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:40.330
There he is!

00:11:51.340 --> 00:11:53.290
Oh no, help!

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:01.980
Why is this happening to me?

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:20.940
I can't breathe!

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:34.580
All I can do is
stand here and watch.

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:37.360
Dammit!
It's just as she said!

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:44.600
That's weird. He's a guy,
but he's wearing a necklace.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:52.470
I was wondering who you were.
It's just Miki and her gang!

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:54.310
Hey sir, what's that?

00:12:56.300 --> 00:13:00.110
I don't know. It was next to my
pillow when I woke up this morning.

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:01.810
What a beautiful necklace.

00:13:01.810 --> 00:13:03.640
You can have it if you want.

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:05.920
Since you're our
own Miss Nakado!

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:09.120
Wow, I'm speechless!
Thank you!

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.490
Excuse me.

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:13.590
A necklace suited
for a beauty!

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:14.750
Lala!

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:17.420
Thank you, sir.
I love you!

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:19.230
Oh, don't mention it!

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:22.600
He gave it to me!
Give it back!

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:25.700
Well, it should go to
the most beautiful girl!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.500
- Give it back!
- No way!

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.670
- Give it back!
- No! I won't!

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:30.600
Come on!

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:34.910
These girls are a lot
scarier than any ghost!

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:35.780
It's mine!

00:13:35.780 --> 00:13:37.760
- He gave it to me!
- Did not!

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:44.290
Oh, my goodness!
That wasn't my fault.

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:46.900
It was, too!

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:49.320
There!

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:52.030
I got it! I got it!

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.230
LALA!

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:54.460
THAT WAS DIRTY!

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:57.500
Akira told us to wait here!

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:01.640
That cheeky little brat!
She must not know about me!

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:03.670
Hey! Wait up, would you?

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:06.170
- It's mine!
- Get back here!

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:11.280
Of all the places...

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:22.070
What's going on here?

00:14:23.260 --> 00:14:26.230
I guess these are mine now.

00:14:26.230 --> 00:14:28.570
But it's no good as a necklace anymore.

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:32.040
I know! I can make
bracelets with it!

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:38.250
These bracelets will set
off my beauty perfectly!

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:44.440
What's wrong, Lala?

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:45.620
Keep it together!

00:14:46.710 --> 00:14:49.520
My beauty has been spoiled!

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:50.460
What?

00:14:53.420 --> 00:14:55.990
A beautiful flower like myself
withers before its time.

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:58.220
It happened after I put on the necklace.

00:14:58.230 --> 00:14:59.530
Necklace?!

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:02.670
That's it, I got it!
Demon Kenetos!

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:08.330
My necklaces have been
scattered all over the world.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:14.810
Soon every human will come to my world
here in the form of unsightly heads.

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:27.700
To kill time as I wait,
I shall tear off your mouth!

00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:35.810
I shall shave off your nose!

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:41.910
I shall gouge out your eyes!

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:03.760
Devilman, if he's defeated,
will I get my hands back?

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:05.740
Of course, however...

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:07.230
However?

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:11.630
I can't do it unless I enter his world.

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:14.610
Wow! There's another necklace here!

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:16.110
A necklace?

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:21.270
They aren't really that interesting
when there're so many of them.

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:22.350
Miki!

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:25.750
Akira, what's going on?

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:27.950
No questions.
Just give me the necklaces.

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:29.520
No way!

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:31.150
You're gonna give them
all to Lala, aren't you?

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:33.090
I want to wear one, too!

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:34.120
Idiot! Put it down!

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:40.660
A ghost!

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:44.070
You can be useful
sometimes, after all!

00:16:56.810 --> 00:16:58.220
Now I can get to Kenetos!

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.790
If I pass through here,
I can enter his world.

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:05.250
Alphonne, Lala, wait for me!

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.560
I'll come back with your
head and hands!

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:23.440
Would you prefer your eyes or your nose?

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:25.340
Or should I tear off your ears instead?

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:27.210
Could you pinch my cheek instead?

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:28.170
What?

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:30.080
Then maybe I'll wake
up from this nightmare!

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:31.980
What a dimwitted human!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.820
Very well. I shall prove to
you that you are not dreaming.

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:39.730
I shall break your skull!

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:41.060
Kenetos!

00:17:43.260 --> 00:17:45.330
Why you!

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:51.440
DEVIL!

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:00.970
How dare you invade the
dark realm of Kenetos?

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:02.550
You will suffer punishment!

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:11.330
Devil Wing!

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:22.040
Devil Cutter!

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:27.410
Kenetos, here I come!

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:34.110
Damn!

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:04.070
Devilman, you went to
the world of Kenetos?

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:06.040
Just to bring back my hands!

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.320
I'm so happy, Devilman!

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:18.360
Devil Beam!

00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:40.950
Akira!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:47.450
Yo!

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:52.090
I'm all right now. The leader
of the ghosts is gone.

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:53.890
No need to worry.

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:57.100
I'm still the same handsome
Akira Fudo, right?

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:00.240
Akira, I'm so glad!

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:03.660
I'm so glad! I was
so worried about you!

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:05.230
Me, too!

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:07.410
I sure am popular!

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:11.400
When did I get to school?

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:15.510
Fudo! Public displays of
affection are against school rules!

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:18.950
Well, is it within school rules
to show up in your underwear?

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:21.050
Oh my!
Please excuse me!

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:50.010
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:56.710
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.550 --> 00:21:04.370
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:10.210
Who Devilman really is

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:14.130
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:17.340
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:22.340
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:33.220
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:53.250
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:59.450
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.950 --> 00:22:04.950
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:12.090
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:16.830
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:19.830
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.830 --> 00:22:26.510
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.970 --> 00:22:36.650
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:23:00.010 --> 00:23:02.310
Fall my shadow!
Run my shadows!

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:04.940
Peel away the so-called
culture and intelligence

00:23:04.940 --> 00:23:07.250
that hides the true human heart!

00:23:07.250 --> 00:23:12.250
Prove beyond a doubt that while they
may call themselves higher primates,

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:14.860
scratch the surface and
they're no more than monkeys!

00:23:15.420 --> 00:23:19.360
I heard that your son placed
into a prestigious preschool.

00:23:19.360 --> 00:23:20.730
It must be very expensive.

00:23:20.730 --> 00:23:25.430
No, price is nothing
for a good education.

00:23:25.430 --> 00:23:28.500
I heard that your son passed the
entrance exam for the magnet school.

00:23:32.510 --> 00:23:36.910
Heh, you always buy the
cheapest pork and fish sausage!

00:23:36.910 --> 00:23:41.110
Your little brat passed the exam?
How much did you "donate" to them?

00:23:41.110 --> 00:23:43.320
You might as well throw
money down the drain!

00:23:43.320 --> 00:23:45.280
You dare say such a thing?!

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:46.990
Yeah I do!

00:23:46.990 --> 00:23:49.900
- How dare you!?
- Hmph! Now you've done it!

00:23:50.420 --> 00:23:51.660
Take this!

00:23:55.260 --> 00:23:56.900
Mama, bye bye!

00:23:57.500 --> 00:24:00.340
Whew, finally free from my tests!

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:07.810
This is the car that almost
hit me the other day!

00:24:07.810 --> 00:24:13.920
Take this!

00:24:19.290 --> 00:24:24.890
Lacock has given the demon
Phizele orders to destroy Devilman.

00:24:25.830 --> 00:24:29.130
The shadows he sends to Earth
take control of human hearts,

00:24:29.130 --> 00:24:32.000
killing the goodness inside them
and turning them into demons

00:24:32.000 --> 00:24:33.980
through his terrible magic power.

00:24:34.670 --> 00:24:37.770
Amidst the chaos,
Devilman fights Phizele.

00:24:37.770 --> 00:24:42.120
But just then, a terrible
incident occurs on Earth.

00:24:42.610 --> 00:24:43.980
Next time on Devilman:

00:24:43.980 --> 00:24:47.190
DEMON PHIZELE
THE INSANE SHADOW
